{"id":"659706","name":"麻糍团","author":"°ZWH","authorId":"11170916","desc":"","cover":"images/659706/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"糯米粉","amount":"200g"},{"name":"玉米淀粉","amount":"60g"},{"name":"白糖","amount":"30g"},{"name":"牛奶","amount":"340g"},{"name":"黄油","amount":"20g"}],"sub":[{"name":"芋头","amount":"适量"},{"name":"牛奶","amount":"适量"},{"name":"炼奶","amount":"适量"},{"name":"白糖","amount":"适量"},{"name":"奶粉","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"血檽米提前放冰箱冷藏浸泡一宿，多加水煮熟，焖一小时再开盖加20g黄油和1勺糖混合均匀。","img":"https://i3r.meishichina.com/atta/step/2024/06/27/20240627171944395514340111170916.jpg?x-oss-process=style/p320"},{"step":2,"desc":"芋头蒸熟，趁热加适量牛奶、炼奶、白糖、奶粉，按自己口味调制。","img":"https://i3r.meishichina.com/atta/step/2024/06/27/20240627171944395708844111170916.jpg?x-oss-process=style/p320"},{"step":3,"desc":"糯米粉200g+玉米淀粉60g+牛奶340g+糖30g混合均匀","img":"https://i3r.meishichina.com/atta/step/2024/06/27/20240627171944395829784011170916.jpg?x-oss-process=style/p320"},{"step":4,"desc":"过筛，盖不怕热的保鲜膜或油纸，水开后大火上锅蒸20的分钟","img":"https://i3r.meishichina.com/atta/step/2024/06/27/20240627171944395935023511170916.jpg?x-oss-process=style/p320"},{"step":5,"desc":"趁热加20g黄油融进去，不烫手以后不断拉伸增加延展性，或者直接丢厨师机里转一会儿","img":"https://i3r.meishichina.com/atta/step/2024/06/27/20240627171944396036499211170916.jpg?x-oss-process=style/p320"},{"step":6,"desc":"备好的料:麻薯皮，芋泥，紫薯，肉松，椰蓉或奥利奥碎，芝士片","img":"https://i3r.meishichina.com/atta/step/2024/06/27/20240627171944396097974611170916.jpg?x-oss-process=style/p320"},{"step":7,"desc":"取一小块麻薯皮按扁","img":"https://i3r.meishichina.com/atta/step/2024/06/27/20240627171944396190428711170916.jpg?x-oss-process=style/p320"},{"step":8,"desc":"加芋泥压实","img":"https://i3r.meishichina.com/atta/step/2024/06/27/20240627171944396262626511170916.jpg?x-oss-process=style/p320"},{"step":9,"desc":"加血糯米压实","img":"https://i3r.meishichina.com/atta/step/2024/06/27/20240627171944396320948011170916.jpg?x-oss-process=style/p320"},{"step":10,"desc":"加肉松压实","img":"https://i3r.meishichina.com/atta/step/2024/06/27/20240627171944396376294411170916.jpg?x-oss-process=style/p320"},{"step":11,"desc":"加芝士片，也可以加咸蛋黄等自己爱吃的一切","img":"https://i3r.meishichina.com/atta/step/2024/06/27/20240627171944396431842611170916.jpg?x-oss-process=style/p320"},{"step":12,"desc":"包成皮薄大馅的团子","img":"https://i3r.meishichina.com/atta/step/2024/06/27/20240627171944396507519511170916.jpg?x-oss-process=style/p320"},{"step":13,"desc":"外面裹上一层椰蓉或者奥利奥碎防沾","img":"https://i3r.meishichina.com/atta/step/2024/06/27/20240627171944396591585311170916.jpg?x-oss-process=style/p320"},{"step":14,"desc":"一口下去糯叽叽的，香香甜甜超好吃","img":"https://i3r.meishichina.com/atta/step/2024/06/27/20240627171944396670063011170916.jpg?x-oss-process=style/p320"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：蒸锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}